\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces The float-plan escrow ceremony --- the atom every side of the market settles on. A three-step \texttt  {ed25519} handshake: the requester signs a FloatPlan (task, machine-checkable acceptance criteria, budget, bounty); the daemon debits and escrows the value inside a single SQLite \texttt  {EXCLUSIVE} transaction; the daemon then signs $\{anchor\_id,\,plan\_hash\}$, proving to the worker that funds are pinned before any work begins. The conservation invariant holds at every step and is the \emph  {built} floor the whole economy stands on --- the one claim this paper can make at BUILT confidence.}}{8}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:he-float-plan}{{3}{8}{The float-plan escrow ceremony --- the atom every side of the market settles on. A three-step \texttt {ed25519} handshake: the requester signs a FloatPlan (task, machine-checkable acceptance criteria, budget, bounty); the daemon debits and escrows the value inside a single SQLite \texttt {EXCLUSIVE} transaction; the daemon then signs $\{anchor\_id,\,plan\_hash\}$, proving to the worker that funds are pinned before any work begins. The conservation invariant holds at every step and is the \emph {built} floor the whole economy stands on --- the one claim this paper can make at BUILT confidence}{figure.caption.6}{}}
